<title>USA: Yamana acquires Chile land position.</title>
<headline>Yamana acquires Chile land position.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamana Resources said it took a strategic land position in the porphyry copper belt of northern Chile in the Taltal province.</p>
<p>The 126-square-kilometer &quot;Viento&quot; mining claims secure compound geophysical anomalies about 90 kilometers south of the huge Escondida mine, Yamana said.</p>
<p>The company is working to define the anomalies.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
